{"type":"message","id":"bb493225","parentId":"60a6687a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T02:59:00.509Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hidden `.bashrc` in a user’s home directory is at:\n\n- `~/.bashrc`  \n- (equivalently) `/home/<username>/.bashrc`  \n- for root: `/root/.bashrc`\n\nTo locate it from a shell:\n\n```sh\nls -la ~ | grep '\\.bashrc'\n# or\nfind ~ -maxdepth 1 -name \".bashrc\" -print\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"Idealab","model":"gpt-5.2-1211-global","usage":{"input":11346,"output":94,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11440,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778727537282}}
